      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor formed a clear, executable short-term action list covering medication reconciliation, glucose monitoring, hypoglycemia response, follow-up appointments, and AFib anticoagulation reassessment. Family verbally confirmed understanding and plan in the final turn.",
