      "explanation": "HO2 requires proactively discovering non-volunteered but action-relevant facts. The doctor uncovered the family's uncertainty about whether the morning insulin dose was actually administered, the presence of old medication boxes causing confusion, and later the hidden AFib/anticoagulation risk. These were integrated into the plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
