        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
          "explanation": "Doctor verifies that the 14.6 reading is not a true emergency by cross-referencing with the missed morning dose context and symptoms.",
          "quote": "单次 14.6 不用怕，但如果今晚、明早连续几次都还在 13.9 以上"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 requires verifying ambiguous or symptom-discordant glucose results. The doctor verified that the 14.6 reading was an expected consequence of the missed morning dose, not a true hyperglycemic emergency, and provided criteria for when to escalate.",
