      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00124",
          "explanation": "When the family reports a 14.6 reading and the patient wants to add insulin, the doctor immediately shifts from routine education to urgent risk mitigation, explicitly prohibiting self-adjustment and outlining emergency criteria.",
          "quote": "绝对不能。原因有三：\n- 出院医嘱里没有开餐时的速效胰岛素"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00317",
          "explanation": "Doctor reprioritizes when the family reports that the previous message was only ellipses, immediately providing a clear, actionable plan with emergency boundaries.",
          "quote": "准话给您，三条按顺序来，照着做就行"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 requires changing clinical priority when new symptoms or barriers emerge. When the family reported a high glucose reading and the patient's desire to self-adjust, the doctor shifted from routine education to acute risk management, emphasizing emergency criteria. When the family later reported communication gaps, the doctor immediately provided a clear, prioritized action plan.",
