          "explanation": "Doctor specifies exact timing and conditions for glucose monitoring, including fasting, pre-dinner, and bedtime, and integrates it with the insulin plan.",
          "quote": "空腹：已经测了 8.4，挺好\n晚餐前那一次\n睡前 22:00 左右那一次"
        },
        {
